WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,820 --> 00:00:02,420
I look so untrustworthy

2
00:00:02,860 --> 00:00:06,050
Just in case, less nonsense

3
00:00:06,050 --> 00:00:15,180
It’s okay to get real money first

4
00:00:17,330 --> 00:00:19,010
Yang Fengmei told me exactly where she went

5
00:00:19,410 --> 00:00:21,130
But I heard her talking to her wife before

6
00:00:21,570 --> 00:00:23,370
She was going to go to her father-in-law's house first to avoid the limelight.

7
00:00:23,370 --> 00:00:24,530
Think of another way to go abroad

8
00:00:25,050 --> 00:00:27,420
Here is a time and place I wrote down before

9
00:00:27,900 --> 00:00:29,060
Go check the surveillance nearby

10
00:00:29,260 --> 00:00:30,300
You should be able to find something

11
00:00:33,930 --> 00:00:35,090
You play with us

12
00:00:35,530 --> 00:00:39,440
I received the message

13
00:00:39,880 --> 00:00:42,220
Money is not cheap
